<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>HAKUBA, Japan 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results of an</p>
<p>alpine skiing World Cup women's downhill competition on Sunday:</p>
<p>  1. Varvara Zelenskaya (Russia) one minute 35.64 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden)	  1:36.09</p>
<p>  3. Renate Goetschl (Austria)	 1:36.11</p>
<p>  4. Hilde Gerg (Germany)		1:36.67</p>
<p>  5. Isolde Kostner (Italy)	    1:36.70</p>
<p>  6. Carole Montillet (France)	 1:36.81</p>
<p>  7. Katharina Gutensohn (Germany)   1:36.82</p>
<p>  8. Heidi Zurbriggen (Switzerland)  1:37.00</p>
<p>  9. Ingeborg Helen Marken (Norway)  1:37.02</p>
<p> 10. Hilary Lindh (USA)		  1:37.17</p>
</text>
